# No co-authored commit trailers

when you commit, never include co-authored line

The commit message never includes co-authored lines.

After `git commit`, check `git log -1 --format=%B`. If a `Co-authored-by` trailer is present, strip it before push using the `commit-without-coauthor` skill.
